{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22424","headline":"寄行简 · 白居易","name":"寄行简","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郁郁眉多敛，默默口寡言。\n岂是愿如此，举目谁与欢。\n去春尔西征，从事巴蜀间。\n今春我南谪，抱疾江海壖。\n相去六千里，地绝天邈然。\n十书九不达，何以开忧颜。\n渴人多梦饮，饥人多梦餐。\n春来梦何处，合眼到东川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22424.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22424","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}